steps.message:
I’ll implement the first working slice now. It will:

- delegate native drag events from the board controller;
- apply the shipped dim/hover classes;
- move the existing card node synchronously on drop;
- insert at the destination’s canonical order (latest first, respecting golden-first columns);
- persist via existing JSON endpoints so no Turbo Stream can later replace/reorder columns;
- expose all transition URLs even for Done/Not Now cards so every cross-status move works;
- normalize stale status styling when moving an already completed/postponed preview.

Then I’ll rerun the failing reproduction immediately.

